            <div xml:id="d452">

                <pb facs="0746" n="620" xml:id="pg620"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/6825: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-12-07T10:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 7,
                                1925—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received December 7—3:04
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>517. My 514, December 4, 1 p.m.<anchor n="38" xml:id="d452-f1"/> Following from
                    American consul, Mukden: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“December 6, 11 a.m. Chang has suffered complete debacle. Young Chang
                            retreated to a place very near to Mukden; position of Chang absolutely
                            hopeless. There is a general exodus from the city. I do not expect any
                            danger to any foreigners. Have heard Marshal will leave today.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
